20w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/04/plants-are-the-best-medicine-hoodie-resource-b-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/04/plants-are-the-best-medicine-hoodie-resource-b.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"/></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>In the DrGreger.org store, you can find digital downloads of our <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/videos\">video collections</a>, <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch\">shirts</a>, and <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/filter-outreach\">outreach materials</a>. </p>\n<h2> </h2>\n<h2><b>The Daily Dozen App</b></h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 70.594479%;\">\n<p>Download the free Daily Dozen app today and start including some of the healthiest foods in your diet. Track your servings, analyze your progress, and learn along the way. The app is available in the <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dr-gregers-daily-dozen/id1060700802\">App Store</a> and <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.nutritionfacts.dailydozen\">Google Play</a>.</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 29.299364%;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-118604 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/04/nutritionfacts-daily-dozen-app-resource-b-960x776.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"258\" height=\"209\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/04/nutritionfacts-daily-dozen-app-resource-b-960x776.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/04/nutritionfacts-daily-dozen-app-resource-b-1024x828.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/04/nutritionfacts-daily-dozen-app-resource-b-768x621.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/04/nutritionfacts-daily-dozen-app-resource-b-1536x1241.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/04/nutritionfacts-daily-dozen-app-resource-b-2048x1655.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/04/nutritionfacts-daily-dozen-app-resource-b-1200x970.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/04/nutritionfacts-daily-dozen-app-resource-b-720x582.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2026/04/nutritionfacts-daily-dozen-app-resource-b-540x436.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 258px) 100vw, 258px\"/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>"
